renal failure. Criteria for inclusion were S-creatinine 1.4mg/dl and 1,84 PTH>6pmol/l (normal 6). Calcitriol 0.125 
ug/day per os was compared with placebo. The patients received calcium carbonate per os if serum P exceeded 1.7 mmol/1. 
