          "study_index": 33,                                                                                            
          "title": "Anaemia in haemodialysis patients of five European countries: association with morbidity and        
  mortality in the Dialysis Outcomes and Practice Patterns Study (DOPPS)",                                              
          "abstract": "Background. The Dialysis Outcomes and Practice Patterns Study (DOPPS) is a prospective,          
