      "study_index": 23,
      "title": "Association of oral calcitriol with improved survival in nondialyzed CKD",
      "abstract": "Parenteral vitamin D is associated with improved survival among long-term hemodialysis patients. 
Among nondialyzed patients with chronic kidney disease (CKD), oral activated vitamin D reduces parathyroid hormone 
