and dialysis dependence in 1418 nondialysis patients with CKD and hyperparathyroidism in the Veterans' Affairs Consumer 
Health Information and Performance Sets database. Incident calcitriol users and nonusers were selected on the basis of 
stages 3 to 4 CKD, hyperparathyroidism, and the absence of hypercalcemia before calcitriol use and then were matched by 
